      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \n\nGroup ID: YTS.6585\n\nWorld ID Thursday: wrld_57f756e9-839d-460b-bab1-0986bbb2f9e0\n\nWorld ID Saturday: wrld_5c941a21-12d2-4b4d-8eab-761042749ead\n\nI do not have any instance IDs as they were past events. It happened at both of our events last week 8/24 - 8/26 Thursday and Saturday at midnight est. The first part of the event seems to goes smoothly with queue working properly, but not sure what causes this issue. Seems to be once the queue either hits a certain number or the instance is X time old. We were getting messages throughout the night that when the queue pops for them they are unable to join the world. Some had to fully restart vrchat to attempt to join queue and join the world.\n\nIt will most likely happen again this thursday and saturday, I can get instance IDs and hopefully some recordings of people running into this issue and what they experience.",
